    "text": "By WRAL Staff ,\n6 hours ago A 27-year-old Wayne County man was arrested on Wednesday after he was accused of sexual exploiting of a minor. According to the Wayne County Sheriff's Office, Carlos Fabian Arriaga Ortega was charged with three felony counts of second-degree child sexual exploitation and one felony count of possession of a schedule II controlled substance. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
